+ *   Device = 1                    WinMM joystick number ("Joystick #1" in RPCS3)
+ *   A = Button 2                  target = sources separated by | (any of them)
+ *   Up = POV Up                   POV Up/Down/Left/Right
+ *   LT = Button 7 | V+            axis halves X+ X- Y+ Y- Z+ Z- R+ R- U+ U- V+ V- (WinMM Y/R grow downwards)
+ *   Left Stick Up = Y-            stick directions take the axis deflection (analog); buttons/POV give full deflection
+ */
